  {%- comment -%} ══════════ TECHNOLOGY ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="sc-section sc-section-alt" id="sc-technology" aria-labelledby="sc-tech-heading">
    <div class="sc-container">
      <div class="sc-section-header center">
        <span class="sc-eyebrow">Understanding the Technology</span>
        <h2 id="sc-tech-heading">What Makes Premium Massage Chairs Premium</h2>
        <p>The difference between a $500 chair and a $9,000 chair is not just features &mdash; it&rsquo;s the engineering philosophy behind every system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-tech-grid">
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-4d">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">4D Technology</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#127919;</span>
          <h3>4D Massage Arms</h3>
          <p>4D rollers move forward, backward, side to side, and at variable speed &mdash; mimicking the nuanced pressure and rhythm of human hands far more closely than 2D or 3D systems. The result is an experience that feels deeply therapeutic rather than mechanical.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-scan">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Body Scan</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128302;</span>
          <h3>Automatic Body Scan Technology</h3>
          <p>Advanced scanning maps the contours of your spine and shoulder width before each session, calibrating roller position, pressure zones, and coverage range to match your exact physiology. Panasonic&rsquo;s scanning system is widely considered the benchmark.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-zerog">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Zero Gravity</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#127760;</span>
          <h3>Zero Gravity Recline</h3>
          <p>Developed from NASA research, zero gravity positioning elevates your legs above your heart, distributing body weight evenly, decompressing the lumbar spine, and significantly amplifying the benefits of every massage stroke.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-air">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Air Compression</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128168;</span>
          <h3>Full-Body Air Compression</h3>
          <p>Strategically placed airbags inflate and deflate in programmed sequences to apply rhythmic compression to shoulders, arms, hips, calves, and feet &mdash; enhancing circulation and creating full-body coverage beyond the spinal roller track.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-heat">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Heat Therapy</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128293;</span>
          <h3>Heat Therapy Zones</h3>
          <p>Intelligent heating elements in the lumbar and calf zones relax tight muscles before and during the massage, improving tissue elasticity and allowing the rollers to work more effectively &mdash; especially important for chronic tension relief.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-tech-card" id="sc-tech-ltrack">
          <span class="sc-tech-pill">Coverage</span>
          <span class="sc-tech-icon">&#128260;</span>
          <h3>L-Track Full-Body Coverage</h3>
          <p>L-track systems extend the roller track beneath the seat, adding comprehensive coverage of the glutes and upper thighs &mdash; crucial for anyone managing sciatic tension, hip inflammation, or lower body fatigue from athletic activity or prolonged sitting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

