  {%- comment -%} ══════════ FAQ ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="sc-section" id="sc-faq" aria-labelledby="sc-faq-heading">
    <div class="sc-container-sm">
      <div class="sc-section-header center">
        <span class="sc-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 id="sc-faq-heading">Massage Chairs in Sacramento &mdash; Your Questions Answered</h2>
        <p>Everything you need to know before visiting our Sacramento showroom or making your premium massage chair decision.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-faq-columns">
        <div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-1">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Where can I try massage chairs in Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Massage Chairs and More is Sacramento&rsquo;s premier destination for experiencing luxury massage chairs in person. Our showroom features fully operational chairs from OHCO, Panasonic, Positive Posture, D.Core, and Koyo &mdash; all available for side-by-side comparison with expert guidance.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-2">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>What is the best massage chair store in Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Massage Chairs and More is widely recognized as the best massage chair store in the Greater Sacramento area. We carry the region&rsquo;s widest curated selection of premium brands with certified specialists on-site to help you find exactly the right chair for your body, lifestyle, and investment level.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-3">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Can I compare OHCO, Panasonic, Positive Posture, D.Core, and Koyo in person near Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Yes. Our Sacramento showroom is one of the very few places in the greater region where you can sit in, compare, and experience all five elite brands side by side in a single visit. Our specialists guide you through the meaningful differences so you can make a genuinely informed decision.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-4">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Are luxury massage chairs worth it?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>A premium massage chair is one of the highest-return wellness investments you can make. Most customers recover the cost within 18&ndash;24 months compared to regular massage therapy sessions &mdash; while gaining on-demand relaxation and daily tension relief available around the clock.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-5">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>What is the difference between a 4D massage chair and a zero gravity massage chair?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>4D refers to the massage arm&rsquo;s range of motion &mdash; forward, backward, side to side, and variable speed. Zero gravity is a reclining position where your legs are elevated above your heart, decompressing the spine and amplifying the massage&rsquo;s effectiveness. Many premium chairs in our Sacramento showroom offer both simultaneously.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-6">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Which massage chair brand is best for me?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>OHCO is for buyers who want the ultimate in luxury design. Panasonic excels in precision body scanning and deep therapeutic performance. Positive Posture offers the best daily comfort balance. D.Core delivers refined Japanese aesthetics for sophisticated buyers. Koyo provides trusted Japanese performance at an accessible premium value. The only sure way to know is to visit our Sacramento showroom and try them.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-7">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Can I book a massage chair appointment in Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Yes. You&rsquo;re welcome to walk in during showroom hours, or call us at (916) 888-0180 to schedule a private appointment. A booked appointment gives you dedicated one-on-one time with a specialist and an unhurried guided comparison &mdash; ideal for serious buyers ready to make a confident decision.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-8">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Why should I visit a showroom before buying a massage chair?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>A premium massage chair is a $3,000&ndash;$15,000+ investment, and every person&rsquo;s experience is different. Height, shoulder width, spinal curvature, pressure sensitivity, and comfort preferences all affect which chair is truly right for you. Visiting our Sacramento showroom removes guesswork and gives you complete purchase confidence.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-9">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Which premium massage chair brands are available near Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Our Sacramento showroom carries OHCO, Panasonic, Positive Posture, D.Core, and Koyo &mdash; five of the most respected premium massage chair brands in the United States. All are fully operational on the showroom floor, ready for side-by-side comparison. We also serve Roseville, Rocklin, Folsom, El Dorado Hills, Granite Bay, Davis, and Elk Grove.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-10">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Is it better to compare massage chairs in person before buying?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Absolutely. The differences between premium massage chair brands are significant and only truly appreciable through direct experience. The depth of the massage rollers, the precision of the body scan, the feel of the upholstery &mdash; none of these come through in product descriptions. Side-by-side comparison at our Sacramento showroom turns a complicated decision into a clear, confident one.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-11">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Do you serve customers in Roseville, Folsom, and Rocklin?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Yes. Our Sacramento showroom serves the entire Greater Sacramento region, including Roseville, Rocklin, Granite Bay, Folsom, El Dorado Hills, Davis, Elk Grove, Citrus Heights, and beyond. Many customers consider the trip well worth it &mdash; because comparing five elite massage chair brands in one visit is an experience unavailable anywhere else in the region.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-faq-item" id="sc-faq-12">
            <div class="sc-faq-q">
              <h3>Do you offer financing for massage chairs in Sacramento?</h3>
              <svg class="sc-faq-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-faq-a"><p>Yes. We offer flexible financing options to make premium wellness more financially accessible. Monthly payment plans can make a $6,000&ndash;$9,000 chair far more attainable than most customers expect. Ask our Sacramento showroom team about current financing promotions when you visit or call us at (916) 888-0180.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
